id: mystic-power-mark
name: Mystic Power
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: Mystic Power (2)'s, for the one Unique Ability - off as its attack is done or its Clash settled, the
# Round's end at the latest.
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Mystic Power: your Might and Saving Throws 1(T) higher for this Unique Ability.
text: >
  Mystic Power (2): If you trigger the 2nd effect of Experienced Fighter, instead of applying its usual effects, increase your Might
  and Saving Throws by 1(T) for the duration of the next Unique Ability you use during this Combat Round.

---

[passive]
might += 1(T);
save.all += 1(T);
